{"data": [{"article": {"title": "5 Ways Memory Will Change the AI Game: Insights from OpenAI"}, "author_id": "1894009363855237120", "created_at": "2026-10-23T04:44:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113491621526614499"], "id": "2113491621526614499", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 393, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Memory is \"an important missing piece that hasn't fully been grappled with in the ecosystem today.\" OpenAI's Thomas Jeng shares 5 ways it will change the AI game.\n\nRead full insights 👇\n\n#BringYourOwnBrain #LivingBrain https://t.co/wQGYo2TKAp", "url": "https://x.com/chatandbuild/status/2113491621526614499"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113481771342090240"]}, "author_id": "1515634264154738690", "created_at": "2026-10-23T04:05:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113481809036226970"], "id": "2113481809036226970", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 109, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot. The always-on agent team.\n\nNot 90%. 100% done. Its own computer — no API needed. A team of bots that work at once and hand off to each other.\n\nAll from a single sentence.\n\n#GrokBot #Turn up the volume and enjoy! 🔊 https://t.co/ATBgtbtD5o", "url": "https://x.com/AventusXcom/status/2113481809036226970"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113481112601444352"]}, "author_id": "815490731041296385", "created_at": "2026-10-23T04:02:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113481151604260988"], "id": "2113481151604260988", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 66, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic just dropped Claude Duet: an always-on agent that works before you ask and pings you when done. The ambient AI race is officially on. Duet vs Dots vs Muse, who wins? #ClaudeDuet #Anthropic #AIAgents #FutureAI #AI https://t.co/GY4FhNA3WS", "url": "https://x.com/JahanzaibJimmy/status/2113481151604260988"}, {"author_id": "1564440303322660865", "created_at": "2026-10-23T02:52:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113463662015029720"], "id": "2113463662015029720", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 215, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113393684209176718", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "the one thing about grok bot is that they approach the \"always on\" agent from the bottom up, instead of from the top down like what hermes and openclaw did \n\nwho needs discord compatibility and kanban boards? normies need a desktop app and a phone app to begin with \n\nim not https://t.co/zrjP6nmlck", "url": "https://x.com/j_yunth/status/2113463662015029720"}, {"author_id": "16414674", "created_at": "2026-10-23T02:03:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113451214645932336"], "id": "2113451214645932336", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 274, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Claude Duet, OpenAI Dots, Meta Muse. Every lab now has an always-on agent.\n\nSame demo every time: morning brief, inbox triage, \"it booked my flight.\"\n\nI've been living with Dots for weeks. The killer use case isn't errands. It found a class action on my home purchase I'd never", "url": "https://x.com/talkaboutdesign/status/2113451214645932336"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113367733572386816", "3_2113367782150832128", "3_2113367836437680129", "3_2113368019460341760"]}, "author_id": "1540938426379563009", "created_at": "2026-10-23T02:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113450339190153658"], "id": "2113450339190153658", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 131, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot,Claude Duet, Meta Muse, OpenAI Dots. every big lab is now shipping an \"always-on\" agent\n\n(simple version: an AI that keeps watching your apps and does stuff on its own, not just replies when you ask)\n\nwhat this actually means \n\nmodels are good enough now. the fight is https://t.co/ov9cPpKPyE", "url": "https://x.com/Shivamshahi77/status/2113450339190153658"}, {"author_id": "2106283746106191873", "created_at": "2026-10-23T01:48:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113447564410261756"], "id": "2113447564410261756", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1093089704373903360", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113208639129612572", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@moritzkremb One part of what we’re trying to accomplish is an agent (Nectovia Bot) that can talk to your other agents, essentially. We also want to enable ways to make it so that you can use any always on agent in our own harness so you don’t need to switch between several apps. Currently,", "url": "https://x.com/nectovia/status/2113447564410261756"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113442857034072064", "3_2113442857025736704", "3_2113442857050951680"]}, "author_id": "1904874970402164737", "created_at": "2026-10-23T01:30:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113442869428298068"], "id": "2113442869428298068", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 75, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "这两个月 AI 个人助理大火🔥从 Grok Bot、Meta 的 Muse、OpenAI 的 Dots，到 Claude 刚出的 Duet……硅谷四巨头终于集体跨过“你问我答的聊天框”，卷向同一个新物种了：自带后台环境、7×24 小时常驻、在持续聊天流里主动干活的 Always-On Agent。  \n\n翻了眼记录，早在 6 月 17 https://t.co/zrPpPmiuaO", "url": "https://x.com/8cnnc/status/2113442869428298068"}, {"author_id": "1181960761251229696", "created_at": "2026-10-23T00:59:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113435176625987667"], "id": "2113435176625987667", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2106, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113097343482642612", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "本日の注目トピック\n\n・Anthropicが常駐型エージェント「Claude Duet」をリサーチプレビューで公開\nAnthropicは10月21日、Claudeが自分から動くエージェントアプリ「Claude https://t.co/JzFSSGx60f", "url": "https://x.com/ak_ten6/status/2113435176625987667"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113425898334834688"]}, "author_id": "1586888828458934273", "created_at": "2026-10-23T00:22:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113425908833165725"], "id": "2113425908833165725", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 195, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "**Scanning For Skynet — Thursday, October 22, 2026**\n1. **Anthropic Dropped Claude Duet — The Agent That Messages YOU First**\n   Anthropic opened a waitlisted research preview of Claude Duet on Oct 21, an always-on agent built on Claude Opus 5.5 that sends you a morning brief, https://t.co/0oTFtsuq3Y", "url": "https://x.com/OnTheBlokkchain/status/2113425908833165725"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113424419083423744", "3_2113424422854152192", "3_2113424425785999361", "3_2113424428587769856"]}, "author_id": "2110904700363251712", "created_at": "2026-10-23T00:17:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113424431452467394"], "id": "2113424431452467394", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic just launched Claude Duet, its answer to Dots and Muse.\n\nAlways-on agent, own virtual computer, runs on Opus 5.5.\nIt asks before it sends, pays, signs or deletes.\nWaitlist, Pro and Max, US only.\n\nMore AI moves: jarvisdailyai dot space https://t.co/KffWR9SCmy", "url": "https://x.com/Jarvisdailyai/status/2113424431452467394"}, {"author_id": "15194582", "created_at": "2026-10-22T23:09:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113407505615499755"], "id": "2113407505615499755", "in_reply_to_user_id": "15194582", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113407502905921614", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Dots (OpenAI)\n\nAn always-on agent inside ChatGPT with its own computer and plugins for 4,000+ apps. Reach it in ChatGPT, Slack or Teams.\n\nNeeds ChatGPT Pro ($100+/mo) or Business Premium.", "url": "https://x.com/cyrilgupta/status/2113407505615499755"}, {"article": {"title": "The Jevons Paradox of AI: Why You’re Busier Than Ever"}, "author_id": "1221544892230512641", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:49:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113387346854810014"], "id": "2113387346854810014", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 217, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "It’s no longer humanly possible to check everything we delegate to AI. \n\nWe need a system that decides what reaches us and what doesn’t, so we stop being the bottleneck in our own work and our attention goes where a skim isn’t enough. https://t.co/Tg4jpd8eW5", "url": "https://x.com/dariacupareanu/status/2113387346854810014"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113385041976049665"]}, "author_id": "146108201", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:40:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113385077921222794"], "id": "2113385077921222794", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Claude Duet is Anthropic's always-on agent bet\n\nAnthropic opened a Claude Duet research preview on Claude Opus 5.5 — iOS, Android, and web. US Pro and Max can waitlist; Team and Enterprise are out. It runs on a cloud VM with a browser and 6,000+ connectors (Gmail, Slack, Stripe), https://t.co/kLtruZjS4D", "url": "https://x.com/Tesla_Optimus_K/status/2113385077921222794"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "13_2113481771342090240", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2113481771342090240/img/qPNNq-hVTE9O2NBA.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2113481112601444352", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVSX38wbQAA8lqu.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2113367733572386816", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVQwwa9awAA2JIX.png"}, {"media_key": "3_2113367782150832128", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVQwzP7bAAAeItZ.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2113367836437680129", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVQw2aKakAE4OEY.png"}, {"media_key": "3_2113368019460341760", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVQxBD-awAAeER7.png"}, {"media_key": "3_2113442857034072064", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVR1FLqaQAAmS7A.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2113442857025736704", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVR1FLobEAAKtUg.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2113442857050951680", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVR1FLub0AAk1yl.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2113425898334834688", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVRlqDlb0AAGbUZ.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2113424419083423744", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVRkT88akAAB4Sl.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2113424422854152192", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVRkUK_bUAAkB7g.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2113424425785999361", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVRkUV6bwAEYM5h.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2113424428587769856", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVRkUgWbYAAbOdb.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2113385041976049665", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVRAf5ybQAEtgh-.jpg"}], "users": [{"id": "1894009363855237120", "name": "ChatAndBuild", "username": "chatandbuild"}, {"id": "1515634264154738690", "name": "AVENTUS", "username": "AventusXcom"}, {"id": "815490731041296385", "name": "Jahanzaib Shahzad", "username": "JahanzaibJimmy"}, {"id": "1564440303322660865", "name": "JYunth", "username": "j_yunth"}, {"id": "16414674", "name": "Max 🇺🇦", "username": "talkaboutdesign"}, {"id": "1540938426379563009", "name": "Shivam – oss/acc", "username": "Shivamshahi77"}, {"id": "2106283746106191873", "name": "Nectovia", "username": "nectovia"}, {"id": "1904874970402164737", "name": "悟空搞钱", "username": "8cnnc"}, {"id": "1181960761251229696", "name": "akane", "username": "ak_ten6"}, {"id": "1586888828458934273", "name": "OnTheBlokkchain 🧙🏽‍♂️🍊🎒", "username": "OnTheBlokkchain"}, {"id": "2110904700363251712", "name": "Jarvis Daily", "username": "Jarvisdailyai"}, {"id": "15194582", "name": "Cyril Gupta", "username": "cyrilgupta"}, {"id": "1221544892230512641", "name": "Daria", "username": "dariacupareanu"}, {"id": "146108201", "name": "Tesla_Optimus", "username": "Tesla_Optimus_K"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2113491621526614499", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlwtp2kth41pjet3yd6e5mqufiwt", "oldest_id": "2113385077921222794", "result_count": 14}}